          "Effect": "Overload an electronic device with a spike of voltage. You induce a minor surge in a device you are touching, causing it to shut down until reset or repaired. Robots and high-tech gear with redundant systems are immune."
        },
        {
          "Name": "Adsorb Power",
          "Range": "Touch",
          "Effect": "Once Per Day: You tap into a Large or bigger generator. Roll an Intelligence check (DC 15). On success, you regain a use of 1 or more of a technique slot (Level 1\u20135 based on the result). Failure deals 1d6 Electric damage to you for every 5 points below the DC. If you beat the DC by 4 or less then regain a Zero level slot. For every 5 you beat the DC gain the ability to either gain a use of a 1 higher level slot or gain another use of the current level slot. For example: a roll of 25 would imply the Electro-Mancer could regain the use of 3 level zero techniques, or 1 level two, or 2 level ones."
        }
      ]
